#: src/newdocument-wizard/kvtnewdocumentwizardintropage.cpp:36
msgid ""
"This wizard will get you started setting up your new document.\n"
"\n"
"With Parley you can practice anything that comes in pairs. For example foreign languages and their translation to your language.\n"
"\n"
"To get started it is necessary to set up what you would like to practice.\n"
"\n"
"On the next page you can choose to use languages or anything else. In that case you can simply define yourself what it is you practice by typing a title for it."
msgstr ""
"Disse Hölper ünnerstütt Di bi't Opstellen vun en nieg Dokment.\n"
"\n"
"Mit Parley kannst Du allens öven, dat in Poren vörkummt, a.B. butenlannsch Wöör un ehr Översetten.\n"
"\n"
"Toeerst muttst Du fastleggen, wat Du öven wullt.\n"
"\n"
"Op de nakamen Siet kannst twischen \"Spraken\" un \"Jichtenswat anners\" utsöken. Wullt Du keen Spraak öven, legg dor eenfach sülven en Titel för fast."

